rent; a directory's open state is its icon and its position in the tree, not color.","File text is a named, focusable region that keeps visible focus; every state of the viewer is text with an icon, never color alone."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Icon, ListItem, SegmentedControl, Segment, CodeBlock, Alert, EmptyState, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (file names, paths, sizes and source text); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","This View models the page content only; the Workbench shell is shown by the Workbench View.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person opened the Product Kit page with ?section=files.","The base state is the dogfood kit project's real listing (node_modules and links left out) with every directory collapsed and no file picked, for a member who holds product-kit.source.read.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench renders the live page and this View is its design reference. Variants that show a binary, too large, removed or unreadable file use sample paths the kit project does not hold."],"intent":"Show the Files section of the Workbench Product Kit page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the kit project's files and build output as a read-only tree, and a viewer that shows one file as text, or says it is not text, too large, gone or unreadable.","interactionRules":["Files and build output are shown read-only: people and Agents change kit code directly, outside UIUX, and Reload lists them again.","A directory opens and closes in place; a file opens in the viewer, which shows its path and size, and reveals the directories above it.","A file is shown as text only, never run or previewed; a file that is not text is described, a file above the read limit says so and where to open it, and a 